{"name":"Democrat","hex":"#00aef3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Democrat","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A member or supporter of a democratic party.","A member or supporter of the Democratic Party in the United States."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or belonging to the Democratic Party in the United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Democrat"}],"entries":[{"title":"Democracy","blocks":[{"text":"Democracy is a form of government in which political power is vested in the people of a certain state. Under a narrow definition of democracy, rulers are elected through competitive elections, while broader definitions also link democracy to guarantees of civil liberties and human rights."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democracy","wikidata":"Q7174"},{"title":"Democrat (Brazil)","blocks":[{"text":"Democrat, originally founded with the name Brazilian Woman's Party, is a social conservative political party in Brazil which uses the number 35. Known for its anti-feminist and anti-abortion stance, the party is not represented in the National Congress."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Logomarca_O_Democrata_35.png/330px-Logomarca_O_Democrata_35.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democrat_(Brazil)","wikidata":"Q24478299"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/The_Parthenon_in_Athens.jpg/500px-The_Parthenon_in_Athens.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/The_Parthenon_in_Athens.jpg/500px-The_Parthenon_in_Athens.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Parthenon is considered a symbol of democracy.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_Parthenon_in_Athens.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikime